  "goodToKnow": "Das Blickfeld is the field of vision: im Blickfeld, außerhalb des Blickfelds. Figuratively, ins Blickfeld rücken means to come into focus or public attention: Das Thema rückt ins Blickfeld der Politik. In traffic, der tote Winkel is the blind spot, a major danger for cyclists next to lorries; Abbiegeassistenten (turning assistants) are now mandatory on new lorries in the EU. Plural: die Blickfelder."
